    {
      "s": "shuowen_jiezi",
      "t": "吏，事君也。从宀从𠂤。𠂤猶眾也。此與師同意。",
      "w": 1
    },
    {
      "s": "wiktionary",
      "t": "Compositionally related to 宮, but approximately analysable as ideogrammic compound (會意 /会意): 宀 + 𠂤 – multiple rooms under a roof, an official building.\nProbably the same word as 倌 (OC *koːn, *kroːns, “servant”) (Schuessler, 2007). See there for more."
    }
